Description:It is your first main phase. You control an Island and three Forests, and have Flash and Nyxbloom Ancient in hand. End the turn with Nyxbloom Ancient on the battlefield.
Rule:rulesguru-1ceabce8bd692899 | A spell's instructions are followed in order (CR 608.2c): Flash puts Nyxbloom Ancient onto the battlefield before you choose whether to pay its mana cost reduced by {2}, so the Ancient already triples the mana of the two Forests left untapped, enough for {2}{G}{G}{G}
